    "text": "By Sophie Martin ,\n22 hours ago Some restaurants serve food, while others serve experiences that happen to include food as one component of a much larger adventure. Patti’s 1880’s Settlement in Grand Rivers, Kentucky has built an empire on the second approach, creating a destination where pork chops the size of catcher’s mitts are just the beginning of the story. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
